cumstances of the case; and (b) obtain and promptly deliver or tender in due form any docu- ment necessary to enable the buyer to obtain possession of the goods or otherwise required by the agreement or by usage of trade; and (c) promptly notify the buyer of the shipment. § 2–504ARTICLE 2. SALES"